  unitName: Svafa (EU)
  unitId: 720113
  unitNumber: 7023
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Svafa is normally harmonious
    and protective to the people that she takes under her arms, especially warriors
    drowning in battle. However, those outside her scope of protection should take
    heed, as she can command the seas and drown an entire city at her will.
  summonDesc: Let my power flow through you.
  fusionDesc: A torrent of rage, as calm as a lake.
